---
layout: layout.njk
title: Benefits
description: Nineteen benefits in four time-to-value tiers.
permalink: /benefits/index.html
eleventyNavigation:
  key: Benefits
  order: 70
bodyClass: page-ledger
---
<header class="page-hero">
  <p class="kicker">Ledger · 19 benefits · four time-to-value tiers</p>
  <h1>What lands, and how soon.</h1>
  <p class="lede">Verified 2026-08-18 unless a row says otherwise. Cursor student rate is closed — it is not on this ledger.</p>
</header>
{% for tier in benefitTiers %}
<section class="tier">
  <h2>{{ tier.label }} · {{ tier.items.length }}</h2>
  <table class="ledger">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Name</th>
        <th>Counterpart</th>
        <th>Term</th>
        <th>Door</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for b in tier.items %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ b.title }}</td>
        <td>{{ b.counterpart }}</td>
        <td>{{ b.terms }}</td>
        <td>
          {% if b.href %}
          <a href="{{ b.href }}" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open</a>
          {% else %}
          <span class="mute">No outbound URL in this preview</span>
          {% endif %}
        </td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>
{% endfor %}
<p class="actions">
  <a class="btn btn-quiet" href="/freshness/">How these stay fresh</a>
  <a class="btn btn-quiet" href="/programs/">Campus programs</a>
  <a class="btn btn-quiet" href="/labs/">Lab watchlist</a>
</p>
